# UI — Formulários & Tabelas

## Formulários → `createFormFactory`

Todo formulário com validação DEVE usar `createFormFactory` (TanStack Form + Zod).

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — form raw, react-hook-form, validação duplicada
// ✅ GOOD
import { createFormFactory } from "@/components/form-factory";
import { createUserSchema } from "@acme/types";

const userFormFactory = createFormFactory({
  schema: createUserSchema,
  defaultValues: { name: "", email: "" },
});

function UserForm() {
  const form = userFormFactory.useForm({
    onSubmit: async (values) => { /* values já validados */ },
  });
  return (
    <form.Form>
      <form.Field name="name" label="Nome" />
      <form.Submit>Salvar</form.Submit>
    </form.Form>
  );
}
```

- Factory declarada **fora** do componente (module-level)
- Schema sempre de `packages/types`
- Validação só no submit — não replique no `onSubmit`

## Listagens → `DataTable`

Qualquer tabela DEVE usar `DataTable` + `useDataTable`. Paginação/sort/busca são server-side.

```typescript
// Colunas em module-level
const columns: ColumnDef<User>[] = [
  {
    accessorKey: "name",
    header: ({ column }) => <DataTableColumnHeader column={column} title="Nome" />,
    meta: { filterType: "text" },
  },
];

function PageContent() {
  const query = useUsersQuery();
  const { table, isLoading, pageIndex, pageSize } = useDataTable({ columns, query, pageCount: query.pageCount });
  return (
    <>
      <DataTable.Toolbar table={table} searchPlaceholder="Buscar..." />
      <DataTable.Content table={table} isLoading={isLoading} />
      <DataTable.Pagination table={table} pageIndex={pageIndex} pageSize={pageSize} />
    </>
  );
}
```

- Colunas **fora** do componente
- Filtros por coluna: `meta.filterType` + whitelist `filterableColumns` no service
- Colunas `select`: inclua `filterOptions`; coluna `actions` sem filtro
- Hook de query repassa `page`, `limit`, `sort`, `search`, `filters` ao tRPC

Detalhes: `apps/web/src/components/form-factory/AGENTS.md` e `data-table/AGENTS.md`.
